# Scripts / deploy

- Keep `scripts/wsl.ps1` and `scripts/dev.sh` as the dispatcher surface. New commands must be wired into both.
- Web-only messaging; no adb, APK, emulator, or native packaging steps.
- Public preview is GitHub Pages CI (push to `main`); do not embed deploy secrets in scripts.
- Prefer extending `_lib.sh` helpers over duplicating Flutter/path logic.
- Tests: prefer focused suites during feature work (`.\scripts\wsl.ps1 test unit|orders|pricing|…`); full `test` before PR/push. Map: `docs/engineering/test-suites.md`.
